<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table A3: </span>Model performance across temperatures on disambiguated and ambiguous contexts. There is no single temperature that consistently yields better performance across models. Performance varies across temperatures without a clear trend.</figcaption>
